					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12670822#post-4396353</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12670822/scp-9999-j#post-4396353</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 11 Oct 2019 15:29:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Vincent Van Gone</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4874299</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I felt like this went on for too long after the 'big moment' (although from my understanding this was part of the joke), which is why I downvoted. I probably would have upvoted if you somehow found a way to make the last line &quot;the steaks keep getting higher&quot;, because that was a great pun, but its impact was too diminished for me.</p> <p>Additionally, there's something about the Apollyon classification which feels weird to me, which makes no sense because it plays perfectly into the article's pun. Maybe if you had an offset with the first page as Euclid/Keter and just a description of some of the earlier events, and then a new revision with the Apollyon class and the logs? I'm not sure if that would help though :x</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12670822#post-4396327</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12670822/scp-9999-j#post-4396327</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 11 Oct 2019 15:01:06 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ManyMeats</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2104082</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is my first -J and that probably shows, but I had fun writing this. It's a bad joke and that's why I love it. Also kind of, in a way, a Shaggy Dog piece.</p> <p>Thanks for cows for being really neat.</p> <p>Please consider reducing your red-meat intake in your diet for the benefit of both animals and the environment. I personally trimmed back to maybe one day a week and it's been a net improvement to my quality of life, and I feel good about it morally. Do research and decide for yourself!</p> <p>EDIT 12/6/2020: I made the GOC guy a Chav. Sorry not sorry.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
